===== Debricking =====

This device supports the kirkwood serial recovery via kwboot.
  - Attach serial cable between device and another computer.
  - Download https://downloads.openwrt.org/releases/21.02.0-rc3/targets/kirkwood/generic/u-boot-nas220/u-boot.kwb
  - Install kwboot binary for your computer.
  - On computer run 'kwboot -t -B 115200 /dev/ttyUSB0 -b u-boot.kwb -p'
  - Apply power to NAS220
  - u-boot.kwb is uploaded and executed.  When complete you will be at u-boot prompt.
  - Follow u-boot install instructions above.
-> [[docs:guide-user:troubleshooting:generic.debrick]]

